{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"3ea536a95e4975b8ebe77976cde16baab162baac7648d81845fd421e8b0ad812","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["清除淫乱之罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我听说在你们当中竟有人与继母乱伦。这种淫乱的事，就是连异教徒都做不出来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你们竟然还自高自大！难道你们不该痛心，把做这事的人从你们当中赶出去吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["现在，我虽然身在远方，心却在你们那里。我已经审判了做这事的人，就像亲自在场一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你们奉我们主耶稣的名聚会时，我的心并我们主耶稣的权能也与你们同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你们要把这人交给撒旦去毁坏他的肉体，好使这人的灵魂在主耶稣再来的日子可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你们自夸不是好事，岂不知一点面酵能使整团面发起来吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你们要把旧酵除掉，好成为真正无酵的新面团，因为我们逾越节的羔羊基督已经被献为祭了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以，我们不可带着歹毒邪恶的旧酵守这逾越节，而要用纯洁真诚的无酵饼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我以前曾经写信吩咐你们，不可与淫乱的人交往。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我的意思并不是指世上所有淫乱、贪婪、欺诈与祭拜偶像的人。那样的话，你们将不得不离开这个世界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我的意思是，若有人自称是信徒，却淫乱、贪婪、祭拜偶像、毁谤、酗酒、欺诈，你们不要和他们交往，甚至不要和他们一起吃饭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["审判教会以外的人与我何干？然而，教会里面的人岂不是该由你们审判吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["上帝自会审判教会以外的人，你们要把那邪恶的人从你们当中赶出去。",{"noteId":8}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"申命记13:15；17:7；19:19；21:21；22:21、24；24:7。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}